{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/15f0c8854500044aebe8b7ae32d202a914cf24f2b796cf3001a5370010d73ffd0153f1746f5e8478395ef8b8e3bfc9611844a75e07ff8a08b8154d0f51f739c0","height":600,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/bSCS76hA4EIKCPKXBBPX7ik3R6amw-3yZVw4HL15ekHWNBpOltFJs1rBcSxBzf6CtqlkjihMYiDRyWZ0GzNrCeZzVIAXm0fTqu4LmjiFd_9X-F-kVn0","width":600},"name":"Ryan Kiley","title":"Designer"},"document_id":5387373241303040,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/c9e4a65ced74640f2aa5d5f4e0a72625978fb933e29c480c449a3f90762c2a6522f3188688d483776d929590f7abeb83128c387d7bc83fd55c276f91bd60f1dc","height":600,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ZCl9MpBvO5iTxojVxpSV2BUTiJMh6JEFunfWeUZYbMVSsYDcRn58_Ze47JVI0NaWeIk06TFWVQHSXtgvCpkRqppcHW4QuDV4H-VVc4eNB6Xx4uQPI10","width":600},"name":"Javier Lopez","title":"Designer"},"document_id":6075518001741824,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/5efce30550d992d71fdbc0a4f5cde65c07a9d0c74c3910a80a543cc169cc9d59b4050c97a518484acab95c9c40ada543274b6e71f4d003f141286baccf3aa43f","height":600,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/x5zhkg_9PF8pDS8VLAJAT0O-rUvWBKmgIL3oTISu2lHFXL-y4y1b9zwn-1NDq4Wa5WCBxABt5RkegV4-LJoxlY2uvlOhbUFY1eQGOASTcdfUx7g6RTw","width":600},"name":"Anna Pfoertsch","title":"Product Manager"},"document_id":5670149022679040,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p>近年来，我们看到屏幕尺寸不断增大的趋势日益明显。这部分归因于平板电脑、大屏智能手机和桌面设备的日益流行。</p>\n<p>在今年的 Google I/O 上，Material Design 将深入探讨面向设计师和开发者的大屏指南最新更新。请留意我们的演讲，并继续阅读，了解 Material 如何帮助你迎接多设备设计的挑战与机遇，以满足应用用户不断增长的需求。</p>\n<h2>设计基础：窗口大小类别</h2>\n<p>大屏设计的首要挑战之一，是打造既美观又易用的布局——同时无需为每种设备形态完全重新设计你的应用。因此，我们没有针对不断增加的设备规格逐一设计，而是创建了窗口大小类别（Window Size Classes），确保布局能在一系列设备上无缝自适应。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>对于更复杂的布局场景，你还可以考虑结合使用宽度和高度类别。不过，对于大多数应用，尤其是采用纵向滚动界面的应用，三个窗口宽度大小类别就能满足你的需求。欲了解更多，请参阅 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/large-screens/support-different-screen-sizes#window_size_classes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Android 的 Window Class Size 文档</a>。</p>\n<h2>布局结构</h2>\n<p>一个典型应用的布局由两部分组成：导航和主体。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>在让设计与人体工学等用户需求取得平衡时，为你的屏幕选择最合适的导航组件是重要的一步。</p>\n<p>面板最适合用来组织应用的主体部分。面板有助于整理内容，并为组件建立清晰的包含结构。它们可以是固定的，也可以是灵活的；既能容纳持久性组件（例如顶部应用栏或搜索栏），也能容纳特定情境下的元素（例如图片、文本、列表、卡片和按钮）。</p>\n<p>面板中的内容可以按多列对齐和展示。列是面板独有的概念，不会在窗口层级使用，从而可以更精细地控制面板内的布局。欲详细了解 Material Design 如何定义<a href=\"https://m3.material.io/foundations/layout/understanding-layout/parts-of-layout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">布局的各个组成部分</a>，请参阅相关文档。</p>\n<h2>硬件</h2>\n<p>新硬件总是令人兴奋——但同时也带来了应对全新且意想不到的使用场景的挑战。Material 的更新指南探讨了如何让你的设计以更少的定制和适配工作，去适应各种硬件规格。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>一个看似棘手的硬件因素示例出现在带有中央铰链的折叠设备上——铰链将屏幕分成两半。在某些折叠设备上，这个区域没有显示硬件，因此屏幕会作为两个独立的面板运作。打开可折叠设备时，应用应在几秒内自动从前屏过渡到展开后的屏幕。</p>\n<p>显示挖孔（例如前置摄像头）也是需要考虑的一种约束，因为它可能遮挡你的部分屏幕设计。在这些场景下，将<a href=\"https://m3.material.io/foundations/layout/understanding-layout/parts-of-layout#40dd6409-2b4d-4354-976b-452006d5615f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">主体区域</a>适当偏移会有所帮助，以确保 UI 的任何部分都不会被遮挡。</p>\n<h2>展望 Material 的大屏未来</h2>\n<p>Material Design 对大屏设计与开发的未来规划，是 Material You 视觉语言的延续。我们的目标是继续推出充满活力、可自适应的大屏体验元素，并始终立足于 M3 的设计理念。</p>\n<p>请持续关注 <a href=\"https://io.google/2023/program/456db54e-d72e-44e2-9522-958f17cf5ece/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">I/O 2023</a>，一览 Material Design 正在酝酿中的一些想法！</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":"There are three window size classes: compact, medium, and expanded","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/8ec42a2b537a5167ee422c7fe1d8af1dfce2b3e6879fc1f6dc7850907f3e9fb96bdba119d514c2f9dcae560d59a4a0b30aca5be52ace3db341058e356a12d938","height":1080,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/FFzfrTw11l9Zs8d9ON2ms7f4WRGHf9dOjEhnjsHTEEwCHjdji_GCTThZHZoFXDiAf1W9_jcGi47KBgaysha1GrDymBjMFXNa0m-7eKhY9kywEYj2K50","width":1920}},{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":"Compact devices use a navigation bar, medium devices can use a navigation rail, and expanded devices can take advantage of a navigation drawer","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/2cbb88dadba9b134dd77d0da5459b858e7f341fa9b674427fab9f668b745ad0f3dd04b57f82925aca59a39c79031ec9b084ed7f2cf9a7a49c1b64d359afba062","height":1080,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/OdxbwYv4pA7vT5w9hd49Pqh4jnmuFbUgJooqIqKS8ByHFcYsuLF34FhSW6qjuh6KNzI4oxPC78Dl6gFWjk_r97xRVAXfvBmZt6cyCfNnT7QNI3kv-KmV","width":1920}},{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":"New hardware comes with new challenges: hinges, on-screen cameras, and rapidly changing window size classes","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/7cbdf3fa54795452bf740deefd4276a4919f2ecbb656977bd40cf5de74defa57b6f8ed61130c266ad75d7e72fae5ff26280e8fa6c1d7e219bcda5adeb5596cb2","height":1080,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/E7-U2j_dicT3wUuNCf4kgkZ04nQl-FKXdtr3qTsCXO7SeJ-52gOO4S3M_aXXzRPygNa5sQNJ6rzmSPjMBE23q-9vdh_tspxUqTPsA0Srf9FXyt7VeuNb","width":1920}},{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/fe32d4d4fcbdcfd27eb85ca37fff18e38ca046f3bddbf853dab05eccd3048d2e398966bf3215dc13bd051ccc443d5e098b884db2546d1d84bc32dba0aea1bbaf","height":794,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/l5dbxlkHHyjIZmFk13LRS1l2YxNyby31QoCYaDwI4sb3oHbVT6t-5-FhTsoj5YR49TZyL_hgEPGB_nyX-0T169HLIp9N_JjlUlKs